    .desc = { ent-BaseStructure.desc }
ent-Bonfire = 篝火 | bonfire
    .desc = 還有什麼比在深夜時分，在星空下與朋友們一起彈吉他更美好的呢？ | What can be better than a late evening under the sky with guitar and friends?
ent-BonfireStake = 篝火與火柱 | bonfire with stake
    .desc = 一堆陰森的篝火，中間插著一根木樁……用來進行某種儀式。最好別問。 | A sinister bonfire with a stake for... ceremonial purposes. Best not to ask.
ent-LegionnaireBonfire = 軍團士兵的篝火 | legionnaire bonfire
    .desc = 在那裡，在熔岩與火山灰交織的土地上，正是烤棉花糖和馬鈴薯的好地方。 | There, in the land of lava and ash, place to to cook marshmallow and potato.
